    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d465">

                <pb facs="0530" n="514" sameAs="frus:frus1947v08/pg514"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">701.6125/10–3047: Telegram</note>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">The Ambassador in Chile</hi> (<hi rendition="#italic"
                        >Bowers</hi>) <hi rendition="#italic">to the Secretary of State </hi>
                </head>
                <opener>
                    <seg rendition="#float-left">
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">restricted</hi>
                    </seg>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">Santiago</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1947-10-30T17:00:00-04:00">October 30, 1947—5
                            p.m.</date>
                    </dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>852. Members Soviet diplomatic representation here, consisting 51 persons, have
                    made arrangements leave in four groups. First group left yesterday, but
                    departure of rest (which includes Ambassador Zhukov) postponed because safe
                    conduct not yet issued Chilean representatives in Moscow.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">Bowers</hi>
                    </signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
